xt\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-field-type-textarea elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-field_1 elementor-col-100 elementor-field-required\">\n<textarea aria-label=\"Message\" class=\"elementor-field-textual elementor-field elementor-size-md\" id=\"form-field-field_1\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Message\" required=\"required\" rows=\"4\"></textarea> </div>\n<div class=\"elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-type-submit elementor-col-100 e-form__buttons\">\n<button class=\"elementor-button elementor-size-lg\" type=\"submit\">\n<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Submit</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</form>\n<aside class=\"gl-contact-options\"><h2>Or, schedule a conversation.</h2><p>If you’d like to speak first, you’re welcome to choose a time for a consultation.</p><a class=\"gl-contact-schedule\" href=\"https://clients.giolina.co/schedule/61f5ca5de95956002dd1c3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Schedule a consultation</a></aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer></script>",
